  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "This, this, these.",
   "texto": [
    "In nominee and in front of a name, «This one» matches it in gender and number: **этот** (masculine), **эта** (feminine), **это** (neutral) and **эти** (plural).",
    "**этот** свитер (this sweater), **эта** куртка (this hunter), **это** платье (this dress), **эти** туфли (these shoes).",
    "The demonstration follows the Russian genre of the noun, although the Spanish is different: **это платье** = «this dress».",
    "Don't confuse him with the **это** you already know («This is»), which never changes: **Это куртка** = this is a hunter.",
    "In nominee, «That one.» matches the same: **тот**, **та**, **то**, **те**. For example, **то платье** = that dress."
   ]
  },
